<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100721" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συν-νεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>contract</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ὀφρῦς</span> Ps.<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philopatr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>incline to a point, converge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ὀξύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Ign.</u>
					51
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἓν κέντρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Num.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ταὐτό</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.666c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν αὐτὴν ὑπόθεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.32.7
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαστρέφεται συννεύουσα ἢ
				παραλλάσσουσα ἄνω ἢ κάτω</span>, of a broken jaw, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				<u>Fract.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ἔνδον</span>
			<i>tending</i> inwards, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				1.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πραγμάτων συννενευκότων</span>
			<i>converged</i> (to a favourable issue), <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				4.10.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bow down together</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.1.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.10.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάτω ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Anach.</u>
				24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>consent, agree</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύννευσον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					1510
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἓν ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Muson.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					14p.73H.
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>invite by beckoning</i>, Thom.Mag.<i><span class="en">
				p.276R.
			</span></i></div>
